@ChatApp.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@AccessToken = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@ConversationId = PASTE_CONVERSATION_ID_HERE
@OtherUserId = PASTE_USER_ID_HERE

### Health (liveness)
GET {{ChatApp.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Health (readiness: SQL Server)
GET {{ChatApp.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Register
POST {{ChatApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "displayName": "Alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Secret123!"
}

### Login
POST {{ChatApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "alice",
  "password": "Secret123!"
}

### Current user
GET {{ChatApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Create direct conversation (idempotent per pair)
POST {{ChatApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/conversations/direct
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "otherUserId": "{{OtherUserId}}"
}

### Create group conversation
POST {{ChatApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/conversations/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Team",
  "memberIds": []
}

### My conversations
GET {{ChatApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Conversation by id
GET {{ChatApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/conversations/{{ConversationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Send message
POST {{ChatApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/conversations/{{ConversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Hello!"
}

### Message history (keyset: ?before={messageId}&limit=50)
GET {{ChatApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/conversations/{{ConversationId}}/messages?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###
